<h2 id="cdcm-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] Every **new or edited** class in scope has ≥1 doc line.
- [ ] Every **new or edited** function/method in scope has ≥1 doc line (except [exemptions](#cdcm-per-symbol)).
- [ ] File header present when the file is new or the module role changed.
- [ ] Non-obvious branches have inline “why” notes where docstrings would be too long.
